'''Bears be Bare''' (雛壇の戦士達, ''Hinadan no Senshitachi'', '''Hinamatsuri Warriors''') is the March event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.1 Update#Version 2.1.3 Update|Version 2.1.3]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Bears Be Bare'''}} is back in the Battle Cats! Visit the {{Color|#FF00000|'''Legend Stages'''}} to face down the panel and show off your talent!<BR>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available March 1st (11:00am) thru April 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Get a chance to unlock {{Color|#0000FF|'''Doll Cats'''}} upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|100%}} chance to collect rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|Treasure Radar item}}!)

※ After you have picked up Doll Cats, unlock it at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Doll Cats from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.

